    featuredImagePrompt: "A wide-angle, dramatic, and conceptual scene depicting the convergence of intensifying El Niño and record ocean temperatures. The image should show a vast expanse of ocean with noticeable heat shimmer or intense color shifts (reds, oranges, deep blues), possibly with abstract representations of atmospheric turbulence or heat rising. In the foreground, subtly integrated elements symbolizing global impact, perhaps a stylized representation of a parched land or a stormy sky over a distant coast. Avoid any human figures or specific buildings. Focus on the raw power and scale of natural forces amplified by global warming. The visual should be impactful and convey a sense of urgency without being alarmist.",
