    featuredImagePrompt: "A sophisticated, industry-specific visual representing the convergence of AI technology, rapid financial growth, and global policy discussions. Picture a stylized, abstract cityscape at dawn, with digital neural networks interwoven through the buildings. One side of the image features upward-trending financial charts and glowing data streams, symbolizing investment and valuations. The other side shows subtle outlines of governmental or regulatory symbols (like scales of justice or abstract policy documents) overlaid with a subtle map of India and the UK, indicating governance. The overall tone is forward-looking and slightly complex, using a blue, green, and gold color palette to convey innovation, growth, and responsibility. Focus on clean lines and a professional, tech-oriented aesthetic, avoiding literal depictions of people or products.",
