    risks: ["Increased regulatory crackdown on stablecoins and tokenized assets.", "Protracted legal battles over asset tokenization, deterring innovation.", "Reputational damage to the crypto industry from illicit finance allegations.", "Stagnation in legislative efforts, leading to continued regulatory ambiguity.", "Potential for reduced institutional investment due to heightened uncertainty.", "Systemic risk if major stablecoins face severe regulatory action."],
