      bearCase: "Bitcoin\'s price could face further downward pressure if US-Iran tensions escalate into broader conflict or if the Federal Reserve continues with aggressive interest rate hikes. The lack of immediate Bitcoin-specific catalysts leaves it vulnerable to global risk-off sentiment, potentially leading to deeper consolidation or a retracement. Investors might continue to withdraw from risk assets, exacerbating selling pressure.",
