      neutralCase: "The crypto industry will continue its trajectory of innovation alongside periodic setbacks in security and regulatory clarity. While some platforms will enhance their defenses and comply more rigorously, others will remain vulnerable. Legislative progress will be slow and incremental, resulting in a mixed regulatory environment globally, preventing neither widespread adoption nor complete collapse, but rather a slow, uneven growth.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Neutral-to-Cautiously Bullish\' outlook. While immediate challenges are significant, the industry\'s resilience and capacity for self-correction, driven by market demand and regulatory pressure, suggest a long-term trend towards greater security and regulatory clarity. The probability of significant negative regulatory action or systemic collapse is mitigated by ongoing innovation and the decentralization ethos, but growth will be tempered by continued vigilance against risks.",
