    outlook: "The immediate outlook for Ethereum and the broader crypto market remains highly sensitive to global macroeconomic and geopolitical developments. A positive resolution to the US-Iran situation could provide a significant tailwind by easing inflation concerns and potentially softening central bank stances. Conversely, a prolonged stalemate or re-escalation would likely reinforce existing macro pressures, keeping risk assets under scrutiny. The selective strength observed in utility-focused altcoins suggests a maturing market where fundamental value will increasingly differentiate projects, regardless of the overarching macro narrative. Investors should anticipate continued volatility driven by external factors.",
