      vestingAnalysis: "As a mature project, Ethereum does not have a typical \'vesting schedule\' for initial team or seed investors in the same way newer projects do. The majority of ETH is in circulation, with new ETH primarily issued as staking rewards. Any significant unlock events for large holders would typically be related to institutional funds or early participants, which are not currently a prominent market narrative.",
      teamAnalysis: "Ethereum was conceived by Vitalik Buterin, and its development is driven by a decentralized global community of developers, researchers, and foundations (like the Ethereum Foundation). This distributed structure mitigates single-point-of-failure risks and fosters continuous innovation.",
