      neutralCase: "The current regulatory actions represent a necessary, albeit challenging, phase of market maturation. While there will be short-term friction and legal battles, these efforts are aimed at establishing foundational rules for consumer protection and financial stability. The outcome will likely be a more regulated, but also more legitimate, crypto market that coexists with traditional finance, balancing innovation with oversight.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A \'Neutral-to-Cautiously Bullish\' outlook. There\'s a high probability of continued regulatory pressure and legal challenges in the short term (60%). However, there\'s also a significant probability (40%) that these actions will eventually lead to greater clarity and legitimacy, paving the way for substantial long-term growth and institutional integration, particularly for compliant stablecoins.",
