    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual visual representing financial market tension: a cracked financial graph showing an upward spiking line (representing bond yields) intersecting with a volatile, downward-trending line (representing equity markets). The background is a muted, abstract representation of global markets with subtle digital data streams, conveying uncertainty and stress. Use a color palette of deep blues, grays, and a contrasting sharp red for the spiking line. The composition should be dynamic, with elements suggesting pressure and fragility, but not chaos. Focus on the interaction of abstract lines and shapes rather than literal images of people or buildings.",
