    risks: ["Regulatory enforcement actions by SEC or other bodies", "Intellectual property disputes over tokenized representations", "Smart‑contract vulnerabilities leading to loss of assets", "Liquidity fragmentation across multiple secondary markets", "Potential for market manipulation in nascent token ecosystems"],
