    socialHeadlines: ["🚨 Big week for crypto! CFTC & SEC push new rules, but a major hack hits Haruko. Meanwhile, EU banks are diving into MiCA. Get the full breakdown! #CryptoNews #Regulation", "Regulation, Hacks, and Banks: The latest pulse on the crypto market. US regulators are on the move, but security risks remain a top concern. #DigitalAssets #FinTech", "Is crypto finally growing up? New rules from CFTC/SEC, plus a surge of banks in EU\'s MiCA. But don\'t forget the Haruko hack reminder: security matters! #CryptoRegulation", "From Washington to Brussels, crypto is making headlines! Dive into the latest on regulatory shifts, institutional adoption, and cybersecurity threats. #Blockchain #MarketUpdate", "The future of crypto is being shaped right now: New rules, big money, and ongoing security battles. What\'s next for digital assets? #CryptoInsights #PulseTrends"],
