      tokenUtility: "Bitcoin\'s primary utility is as digital gold, a store of value, and a peer-to-peer electronic cash system. Ethereum\'s utility is broader, serving as the fuel (gas) for transactions and computational services on its network, and as the native currency for its vast ecosystem of dApps, NFTs, and DeFi protocols.",
