    outlook: "The immediate outlook for Bitcoin appears cautiously optimistic, supported by strong technical indicators and a renewed buying interest. If Bitcoin can consolidate above the $80,000 level and maintain support from the reclaimed moving averages, it could target higher resistance zones. However, the market remains sensitive to regulatory pronouncements and broader macroeconomic shifts. The submission of the CFTC\'s regulation plan to the White House suggests an ongoing effort to integrate crypto into existing financial frameworks, which could bring long-term stability but also short-term uncertainty.",
