      tokenUtility: "Bitcoin\'s primary utility is as a decentralized store of value, a medium of exchange, and a unit of account. It is used for remittances, online payments, and as a hedge against inflation or traditional financial system instability. Its fixed supply makes it a deflationary asset.",
      tokenomics: "Bitcoin has a fixed maximum supply of 21 million coins. New bitcoins are introduced into circulation through a process called \'mining,\' which involves solving complex computational puzzles. The reward for mining new blocks is halved approximately every four years, an event known as \'halving,\' which reduces the rate of new supply creation and contributes to its scarcity.",
